window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-159-9a55faeef9a54fa3.json"]={sha256:"9a55faeef9a54fa3bd2f6b4a0d20667690ae51a7b850630bc9698e3fd0ea29f3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-6e1f064aaabebd71","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.873.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.873.1: Optical transport network linear protection","titleEn":"ITU-T G.873.1: Optical transport network linear protection","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-159","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-159","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-160","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/itu-t-g-872-2024-03-architecture-of-the-optical-transport-network"],"title":"G.872 多層路由：共享風險與假備援","titleEn":"G.872 multilayer paths: shared risk and false redundancy","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學恢復上限50 ms；35通過、55不通過；此50 ms是本題門檻，不宣稱所有設備標準保證。 protection_events.csv與資料/控制恢復時間線 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 35 與變更 55 ms、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching recovery limit50 ms:35 passes and55 fails; this is the exercise budget, not a universal equipment guarantee. protection_events.csv and data/control recovery timeline Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 35 and changed 55 ms, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學雙路失效上限0.001；獨立模型通過、共同風險模型失敗；未知共享關係不能假設獨立。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching dual-failure limit0.001: independent case passes and shared-risk case fails; unknown sharing is not evidence of independence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成偵測10 ms、確認5 ms、切換20 ms；變更偵測30 ms，其他固定。 名義式 10+5+20 = 35 ms；變更式 30+5+20 = 55 ms。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以最後正常與第一個恢復封包時間戳量中斷，再核對事件三段；給各記錄相同時基。","合成各路獨立失效機率0.02，雙路全失效為乘積；變更加入共同管道事件機率0.01，條件獨立其餘不變。 名義式 0.02*0.02 = 0.0004 probability；變更式 0.01+(1-0.01)*0.02*0.02 = 0.010396 probability。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用共同事件/非共同事件的互斥樹枚舉；核對機率和1，不能把共同事件重複相加。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic detection10 ms, validation5 ms and switching20 ms; change detection to30 ms. Nominal 10+5+20 = 35 ms; changed 30+5+20 = 55 ms. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Measure the gap from last good to first recovered packet and reconcile three event intervals on a common timebase.","Synthetic independent path failure0.02 each; changed case adds a0.01 common-duct event with independent residual failures conditional on no common event. Nominal 0.02*0.02 = 0.0004 probability; changed 0.01+(1-0.01)*0.02*0.02 = 0.010396 probability. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate disjoint common-event/no-common-event branches; verify total probability1 and avoid double counting.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-169","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en"],"title":"PON 上行突發：近遠端接收動態範圍","titleEn":"PON upstream bursts: near-far receiver dynamic range","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學恢復上限50 ms；35通過、55不通過；此50 ms是本題門檻，不宣稱所有設備標準保證。 protection_events.csv與資料/控制恢復時間線 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 35 與變更 55 ms、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching recovery limit50 ms:35 passes and55 fails; this is the exercise budget, not a universal equipment guarantee. protection_events.csv and data/control recovery timeline Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 35 and changed 55 ms, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學可接受動態範圍20 dB且每端絕對功率均合格；21 dB組失敗，16 dB仍需個別端點檢查。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching dynamic-range limit20 dB plus valid absolute endpoints;21 dB fails while16 dB still requires endpoint checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成偵測10 ms、確認5 ms、切換20 ms；變更偵測30 ms，其他固定。 名義式 10+5+20 = 35 ms；變更式 30+5+20 = 55 ms。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以最後正常與第一個恢復封包時間戳量中斷，再核對事件三段；給各記錄相同時基。","合成最強−8 dBm、最弱−24 dBm；變更最弱−29 dBm，強端保持。 名義式 -8-(-24) = 16 dB；變更式 -8-(-29) = 21 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 轉為mW再取最強/最弱比的10log10；把過載與靈敏度限制各列一條，不能只比差值。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic detection10 ms, validation5 ms and switching20 ms; change detection to30 ms. Nominal 10+5+20 = 35 ms; changed 30+5+20 = 55 ms. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Measure the gap from last good to first recovered packet and reconcile three event intervals on a common timebase.","Synthetic strongest burst−8 dBm and weakest−24 dBm; change the weakest to−29 dBm. Nominal -8-(-24) = 16 dB; changed -8-(-29) = 21 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Convert to mW and recover10log10 of the power ratio; check overload and sensitivity independently of the range.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-6422145c3e3048c3","url":"https://www.itu.int/epublications/publication/itu-t-g-872-2024-03-architecture-of-the-optical-transport-network","title":"ITU-T G.872: Architecture of the optical transport network","titleEn":"ITU-T G.872: Architecture of the optical transport network","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-63f053269be6eab5","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","titleEn":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
